.EE
.PP
A lock many readers can hold at once, or one writer. A waiting writer goes before readers that come after it.
.SS Once
.EX
struct Once {
    i32 done;
    Mutex m;
};
.EE
.PP
Runs a function once, whichever threads call run() and however many times: the others wait until it has run. One that throws hasn't run: the next call tries again.
.SS Worker
.EX
struct Worker {
